  "summary": {
    "text": "Command R+ 08-2024 is Cohere's August 2024 update of Command R+, a text-only language model with a 128k-token context, released on 30 August 2024 with the updated Command R on the Cohere API, Amazon SageMaker and Oracle OCI, and on Microsoft Azure from September. Cohere reports higher throughput and lower latency on the same hardware; research weights have 104 billion parameters.",
